cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Nailfold Capillaroscopy Annotator"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based tool for annotating and counting nailfold
  videocapillaroscopy images. Marks capillaries, giant capillaries,
  abnormal shapes and microhaemorrhages, measures capillary diameter
  in micrometres, and exports counts per image. All processing runs
  locally in the browser.
type: software
version: "2.4"
date-released: 2026-08-27
